    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818530/extras/16fe1b7a1965c1c19161169bd7344b78.avif?t=1753271482\" data-has-big width=800 height=780 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In XasturSpa, you play as a small business owner running your very own spa.<br>Provide relaxing massages, refreshing showers, and luxurious pedicure treatments to your beautiful female customers. They love your services so much, they enjoy them fully nude.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your reputation, expand your spa, and open new franchise locations to build a true wellness empire!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shower</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use high-quality body care products for your customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can serve 1\u20133 customers at the same time in the shower area.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818530/extras/244ab0d978c26ea3e88aa427368bfd01.avif?t=1753271482\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Massage</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Give relaxing massages\u2014your customers will react with cute, happy sounds when they enjoy it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818530/extras/190c2713326e414c2d2cf9b286f37b86.avif?t=1753271482\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pedicure</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create stylish pedicures for your customers' lovely feet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818530/extras/196a114da8a4418d0a2e35df6986fcd3.avif?t=1753271482\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Main Goal</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When starting your business, your dream was to build a spa empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your first big milestone is to earn $10,000 to open your next spa location.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But remember: some orders will require extra furniture or items, so invest wisely to grow your profits!</p>",
